E. Proof pull
  The finite mixed side of the AP-tail bridge is now an explicit four-row
  certificate: exactly four low-rank escapes survive in each transient row,
  with mirror-paired endpoint labels and no component-audit failures.  After
  HYP-3456 closed the escape-count clock, the remaining AP-tail work is to
  import/prove the HYP-3431 fixed-corridor carrier as the low branch-union
  theorem and splice HYP-3454/HYP-3456/HYP-3457 into HYP-3439.

